# Machine-generated: rebuilt in seconds by tools/, so keeping 2.5 MB of it in
# the repo buys nothing and makes every diff unreadable.
#
#   deck-ast.json / .txt   tools/deck_ast.py
#   deck-abi.json          tools/dispatch_table.py
#   deck-readers.json      tools/extract_dispatch.py
#   dispatcher-map.json    tools/extract_dispatch.py
#   use-sites.json         tools/extract_dispatch.py
#   roundtrip-matrix.json  tools/roundtrip_matrix.py
#
# assumptions.json is NOT generated — it is hand-authored, each entry carrying
# its justification, evidence and risk. It is the one file here that cannot be
# rebuilt, and it is tracked deliberately.
deck-ast.json
deck-ast.txt
deck-abi.json
deck-readers.json
dispatcher-map.json
